A quote opened on an item's marker line attaches a quote at its own depth

```
- > > q
  > +
  > > r
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>q</p>
        <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
      </blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > > > q
  > +
  > > r
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
        <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
      </blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
: > > q
  > +
  > > r
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>q</p>
        <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
      </blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
</dl>
```
